{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien Street Battle</strong> is an action-packed, mission-based game where you fight to save the city from a full-scale alien invasion\u2014while keeping your sense of humor intact. As the city\u2019s last line of defense, you\u2019ll take on daring missions, battle waves of extraterrestrial enemies, and navigate the chaos of an urban warzone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with an ever-expanding arsenal, you\u2019ll clear out alien strongholds, rescue stranded civilians, and take down towering bosses\u2014all while dealing with clueless bystanders, malfunctioning gear, and teammates who may or may not know what they\u2019re doing. The stakes are high, but that doesn\u2019t mean there isn\u2019t time for a few one-liners and some accidental property damage. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1221070?t=1771259196","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1221070?t=1771259196","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1221070/f75925d830376c444ac8b60d75d3fee188d6d7c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771259196","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1221070/f75925d830376c444ac8b60d75d3fee188d6d7c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771259196","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alien Street Battle</strong> is an action-packed, mission-based game where you fight to save the city from a full-scale alien invasion\u2014while keeping your sense of humor intact. As the city\u2019s last line of defens